00:01:04.260 --> 00:01:05.640
- What was your favorite musical?

00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:09.150
- I did many, but I'd say
my favorite was probably

00:01:09.150 --> 00:01:10.350
Seven Brides for Seven Brothers.

00:01:10.350 --> 00:01:11.460
I loved playing Milly.

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:12.293
You know what it was?

00:01:12.293 --> 00:01:14.003
This is actually interesting,
I've never told anybody this.

00:01:14.003 --> 00:01:14.960
Good job interviewing.

00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:18.200
Um, I-I was doing Seven Brides, um uh,

00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:19.870
for Seven Brothers, it was one night,

00:01:19.870 --> 00:01:22.590
and um, it was double cast that year,

00:01:22.590 --> 00:01:24.250
and that had never happened in our time,

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:25.900
and so the other cast got all the shows.

00:01:25.900 --> 00:01:26.852
We got like one

00:01:26.852 --> 00:01:27.685
[Hiss]

00:01:27.685 --> 00:01:28.518
- I know.

00:01:28.518 --> 00:01:30.140
Anyway, but, and we worked so hard,

00:01:30.140 --> 00:01:31.860
but we got to that one song, One Man,

00:01:31.860 --> 00:01:33.230
and it was actually the first time,

00:01:33.230 --> 00:01:34.170
cause I grew up singing opera,

00:01:34.170 --> 00:01:35.993
It was the first time I
found like, my chest voice.

00:01:35.993 --> 00:01:38.220
My gut voi- like and
really started belting out.

00:01:38.220 --> 00:01:39.760
And it was like such a freeing moment.

00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:41.130
- Wait wait, what's the difference though?

00:01:41.130 --> 00:01:42.040
- Um it was like basi-

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:43.050
Oh you know Sister Act?

00:01:43.050 --> 00:01:44.630
You know when she does the
thing with the stomach?

00:01:44.630 --> 00:01:45.480
Oh Happy Day?

00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:47.240
- So its like the diaphragm difference.

00:01:47.240 --> 00:01:48.960
- Yeah, it's just using all, it's, yeah,

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:50.480
and it was just kind of
switching gears for me

00:01:50.480 --> 00:01:51.372
From doing opera, and you
have to be so perfect,

00:01:51.372 --> 00:01:52.890
and you have to be.

00:01:52.890 --> 00:01:55.160
It became less about
perfection, and technique,

00:01:55.160 --> 00:01:56.380
and more about passion,

00:01:56.380 --> 00:01:58.740
and it was a really really
awesome moment for me.

00:01:58.740 --> 00:02:00.330
I felt like I was flying on stage.

00:02:00.330 --> 00:02:03.328
I've never told that
story in my whole life.

00:02:03.328 --> 00:02:04.745
